      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom where we left off in part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19991\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19991\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"QUIT\") to return to the main menu.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
