    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFrom where we left off in part \u003cb\u003ea\u003c/b\u003e, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19992\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19992\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"QUIT\") to return to the main menu. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19993\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtrace.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19993\u0026quot;,240)\"\u003e (\"MEAS\") for the measurement tools.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_3b_80/f-80-3b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19994\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e to find the area.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19995\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e to find the area.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_3b_80/f-80-3b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMake sure the cursor is over a vertex, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19996\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19996\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMake sure the cursor is over one of the vertices of the trapezoid, and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19997\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19997\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the area as 40 square units.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_3b_80/f-80-3b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
